Package: latentoverlap
Type: Package
Title: Correcting Total Score Associations for Measurement Overlap
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Paul", "Lodder",
      email = "paultwinlodder@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: When two constructs are measured with partly overlapping items, their observed 		total-score correlation may partly reflect shared item content rather than a construct-		level association. The latentoverlap package re-expresses the observed total-score 		correlation as the latent association implied by an explicit measurement model.
